flowchart TD
    U[User tap / input] --> W[Flutter Widgets<br/>features/*]
    W --> S[AppState<br/>ChangeNotifier]
    S --> R[Repo<br/>all SQL, parameterised]
    R --> DB[(SQLite on device<br/>sqflite)]
    DB --> R
    R --> S
    S --> W

    W --> CC[ChatController]
    CC --> OE[Offline engine<br/>TF-IDF + constraints]
    OE --> CC
    CC --> GS[GeminiService]
    GS -->|HTTPS, key via dart-define| API[Gemini API<br/>or Cloudflare Worker]
    API --> GS
    GS -->|reply or null| CC
    CC -->|null => fallback| OE
    CC --> W

    subgraph Never leaves the device
        DB
        OE
    end
